    "King Sejong the Great commissioned Hunminjeongeum in 1443. He declared that the common people needed a phonetic script that could be learned easily in a single morning, replacing complex classical Chinese characters.": "世宗大王は1443年に訓民正音を創製しました。難しい漢字の代わりに、民衆が一朝で学べる科学的な表音文字を完成させました。",
