    "Seokjojeon (Western Stone Hall) & beautiful stonewall walkways": "石造殿（西式石造建筑）与美丽的石墙路",
    "Myeongjeongjeon Hall & the serene Chundangji Pond": "明政殿与宁静的春塘池",
    "Sungjeongjeon (Throne Chamber) nestled in lush greenery": "依山傍水、掩映在绿树丛中的崇政殿",
    "The primary and grandest royal palace of the Joseon Dynasty. Located in northern Seoul, its majestic throne hall, Geunjeongjeon, and the floating pavilion, Gyeonghoeru, standing over a serene lotus pond, epitomize traditional Korean royal architecture.": "朝鲜王朝的第一大法定宫殿。位于首尔北部，其雄伟的大殿勤政殿和矗立在宁静荷花池上的庆会楼，集中体现了韩国传统的皇家建筑美学。",
    "Renowned as a UNESCO World Heritage site, this palace was favored by many Joseon kings because it blends seamlessly with the surrounding natural topography instead of imposing upon it.": "联合国教科文组织世界文化遗产。这座宫殿深受朝鲜历代国王的喜爱，因为它巧妙地依山顺水而建，与周边的自然景观融为一体。",
    "Unique among Seoul's palaces, Deoksugung is famous for its eclectic architectural elements, incorporating neoclassical Western-style stone buildings alongside traditional Korean wooden structures.": "在首尔的宫殿中独具特色，它将传统的韩式木质殿宇与新古典主义风格的西式石造建筑完美融合，极极艺术魅力。",
    "Originally built by King Seongjong of the Joseon Dynasty as a residence for queens and dowagers, Changgyeonggung features elegant, authentic Korean wooden halls like Myeongjeongjeon (the oldest remaining main hall among Seoul's palaces) and is celebrated for its harmonious blending of stone, water, and ancient pine trees.": "由朝鲜成宗国王为大妃和王妃修建的宫殿。它拥有首尔宫殿中最古老的大殿「明政殿」，因奇石、幽水、古松交相辉映的幽静景致而闻名。",
    "Known as the Western Palace of the secondary royal residences, it served as a shelter during emergencies. It is nestled quietly beside the Seoul Museum of History and offers a peaceful sanctuary of raw traditional lines.": "又称“西阙”，曾是朝鲜君王在紧急情况下的避难行宫。它静静地矗立在首尔历史博物馆旁，拥有一份大隐于市的清幽和古朴的传统线条。",
    "Rent a Hanbok (traditional Korean dress) nearby to gain free admission! Visit in the morning to catch the guard ceremony at 10:00 AM or 2:00 PM.": "在附近租赁韩服可以免费入场！建议在上午访问，观看上午10:00或下午2:00的守门将换岗仪式。",
    "The Secret Garden requires a separate, guided-only ticket which sells out quickly. Reserve online weeks in advance to secure your spot.": "后苑（秘苑）需要单独购买由导游带领的门票，极为抢手。建议提前几周在线预约以确保名额。",
    "Stroll down the Deoksugung Stonewall Path (Doldam-gil) during autumn when the ginkgo leaves turn brilliant golden yellow. It's open until 9:00 PM for stunning night views.": "在秋季银杏叶染成灿烂金黄时，漫步德寿宫石墙路（贞洞路）。宫殿开放至晚上9点，夜景极美。",
    "Excellent for escaping crowds and enjoying quiet contemplation. The traditional wooden eaves look majestic against seasonal trees, and the evening lit-up paths around Chundangji Pond offer an unforgettable experience of peace.": "非常适合避开人流、静静沉思。古朴的木质飞檐与四季林木相得益彰，夜晚春塘池畔亮起的灯光带给您难忘的宁静体验。",
    "Admission is completely free. Its quiet, uncrowded courtyard makes it perfect for photography of classic wooden eaves and stone steps.": "入场完全免费。这里游人稀少、环境清幽，非常适合拍摄古色古香的传统飞檐与石阶照片。",
