    "Modern Innovation": "现代创新与前沿科技",
    "Korean cuisine, or Hansik, is founded on the philosophy of balance—combining five colors (obangsaek) representing nature's elements, and utilizing patient fermentation techniques to extract deep, gut-healthy umami flavors.": "韩国传统餐饮基于均衡哲学，结合代表大自然元素的五方色，利用时间沉淀的发酵技术，提炼出健康益肠的深层鲜美风味。",
    "From the soft folds of Hanbok silk to the delicate earthiness of Onggi earthenware, Korean traditional art celebrates the inherent grace of natural materials left unspoiled.": "从丝绸韩服柔美的褶皱曲线，到呼吸的泥土陶器“Onggi”的古朴粗粝，韩国传统艺术崇尚并保留了自然材质最本真的典雅之美。",
    "The rise of Hallyu (Korean Wave) has transformed South Korea into a primary exporter of global pop culture, blending hyper-synchronized performances, cinema, and digital narratives.": "韩流（Hallyu）的兴起使韩国跃升为全球流行文化的主要输出国，融合了高度同步的舞台群舞、叙事精彩的电影以及数字创意。",
    "Korea seamlessly pairs ancient heritage with hyper-modernity, leading global networks in semiconductor design, AI-driven public services, and cutting-edge ecological architecture.": "韩国在守护千年文化遗产的同时，也走在现代科技的前沿。在半导体、AI智能城市、尖端绿色建筑领域引领全球创新。",
