    "Korea's Easternmost Boundary": "韩国最东端的疆界",
    "Dokdo: The Beautiful Island of Korea": "独岛：美丽的韩国岛屿",
    "First integrated into Korean territory in 512 AD by Silla Dynasty General Isabu, Dokdo has stood as an integral part of the Korean nation for over 1,500 years. This majestic volcanic island in the East Sea (Natural Monument No. 336) is renowned for its incredible marine biodiversity, towering basalt structures, and its timeless significance as a symbol of Korean sovereignty and natural majesty.": "公元512年新罗异斯夫将军归服于山国以来，独岛作为韩国不可分割的固有领土已历经1500余年。作为天然纪念物第336号，它拥有壮丽的海蚀柱状节理与繁盛的海洋生态，是韩国领土主权与地理之美的永恒象征。",
    "Explore Natural Monument details": "查看天然纪念物独岛详情",
